   "source": [
    "# Stock Trading Recommending System using enhanced ML with core in Peak Valley Agorithm\n",
    "\n",
    "Built a smart trading system for AAPL stock using a machine learning model called LSTM to predict prices and make buy/sell decisions. The core Peak Valley Algorithm spots key price highs and lows to trigger trades. Pulled stock data from Yahoo Finance, cleaned it with Pandas, and trained the model. Created a user-friendly Streamlit dashboard with light/dark modes, showing profit trends, portfolio growth, stock holdings, and trade signals through charts. Added a slick Stocks Tracker with cards for trades, profits, and a win rate gauge\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "5e22e24c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import requests\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import time\n",
    "from datetime import datetime"
